# Cessna 172S Skyhawk - MFD checklist set (G1000 NXi Checklist page group).
#
# Auto-selected when the loaded aircraft is a Cessna 172 (acf_ICAO "C172" or an
# acf_relative_path matching the Skyhawk). Values follow the 172S POH normal
# and emergency procedures; an aircraft may still override these by shipping its
# own g1000_checklist.txt next to the .acf.
#
# Format (whitespace/indentation is cosmetic; keywords drive the structure):
#   GROUP <name>          starts a checklist group (NORMAL / EMERGENCY)
#   CHECKLIST <name>      starts a checklist within the current group
#   <text> : <response>   a checklist item; the response is optional

GROUP NORMAL PROCEDURES

  CHECKLIST BEFORE STARTING ENGINE
    Preflight Inspection : COMPLETE
    Passenger Briefing : COMPLETE
    Seats, Belts, Harnesses : ADJUST AND LOCK
    Brakes : TEST AND SET
    Circuit Breakers : CHECK IN
    Avionics Switch (BUS 1, BUS 2) : OFF
    Fuel Shutoff Valve : ON

  CHECKLIST ENGINE START
    Mixture : RICH
    Throttle : OPEN 1/4 INCH
    Beacon Light : ON
    Master Switch (ALT and BAT) : ON
    Fuel Pump : ON THEN OFF
    Ignition Switch : START (RELEASE)
    Oil Pressure : CHECK
    Avionics Switch (BUS 1, BUS 2) : ON
    Ammeter and Voltmeter : CHECK

  CHECKLIST BEFORE TAKEOFF
    Parking Brake : SET
    Flight Controls : FREE AND CORRECT
    Flight Instruments : CHECK AND SET
    Fuel Quantity : CHECK
    Mixture : RICH (BELOW 3000 FT)
    Throttle : 1800 RPM
    Magnetos : CHECK (MAX DROP 150 RPM)
    Engine Instruments : CHECK
    Annunciator Panel : CHECK
    Throttle : 1000 RPM
    Flaps : SET FOR TAKEOFF (0 - 10 DEG)
    Elevator Trim : SET FOR TAKEOFF

  CHECKLIST CRUISE
    Power : 2200 - 2700 RPM
    Elevator Trim : ADJUST
    Mixture : LEAN
    Engine Instruments : MONITOR

  CHECKLIST BEFORE LANDING
    Seats, Belts : SECURE
    Fuel Shutoff Valve : ON
    Mixture : RICH
    Landing Light : ON
    Autopilot : DISENGAGE
    Flaps : AS DESIRED (BELOW 110 KIAS)

  CHECKLIST AFTER LANDING
    Flaps : UP
    Landing Light : OFF
    Transponder : STBY

  CHECKLIST SHUTDOWN
    Parking Brake : SET
    Throttle : IDLE
    Avionics Switch (BUS 1, BUS 2) : OFF
    Mixture : IDLE CUTOFF
    Ignition Switch : OFF
    Master Switch (ALT and BAT) : OFF
    Fuel Shutoff Valve : ON

GROUP EMERGENCY PROCEDURES

  CHECKLIST ENGINE FAILURE DURING TAKEOFF ROLL
    Throttle : IDLE
    Brakes : APPLY
    Wing Flaps : RETRACT
    Mixture : IDLE CUTOFF
    Ignition Switch : OFF
    Master Switch : OFF

  CHECKLIST ENGINE FAILURE IN FLIGHT
    Airspeed : 68 KIAS
    Mixture : RICH
    Fuel Shutoff Valve : ON
    Fuel Pump : ON
    Ignition Switch : BOTH (THEN START)
    Best Glide : ESTABLISH 68 KIAS

  CHECKLIST ENGINE FIRE IN FLIGHT
    Mixture : IDLE CUTOFF
    Fuel Shutoff Valve : OFF
    Master Switch : OFF
    Cabin Heat/Air : OFF
    Airspeed : 100 KIAS
    Forced Landing : EXECUTE
